WEBVTT

00:00.710 --> 00:02.290
<b>I'm Arale Nakamachi.</b>

00:02.420 --> 00:05.300
<b>My dream is to talk
to everyone through songs!</b>

00:05.840 --> 00:07.420
<b>- To talk?
- Right!</b>

00:07.840 --> 00:11.680
<b>When I sing, people
laugh and sing along, right?</b>

00:11.800 --> 00:17.060
<b>And when it all gets mixed together,
that's when we can talk through songs!</b>

00:24.020 --> 00:25.070
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

00:25.190 --> 00:27.400
<b>- Good morning.
- Good morning.</b>

00:28.700 --> 00:30.280
<b>This isn't fake, is it? lol</b>

00:30.610 --> 00:31.950
<b>How's the songwriting going?</b>

00:32.740 --> 00:36.290
<b>Yuno-san-chan's been telling me
to hurry up, but...</b>

00:36.450 --> 00:37.790
<b>I see.</b>

00:37.960 --> 00:40.290
<b>Shiroyama</b>

00:40.540 --> 00:42.630
<b>- Thank you for the meal.
- Ugh.</b>

00:42.790 --> 00:44.250
<b>Another gloomy phase?</b>

00:44.380 --> 00:45.210
<b>No.</b>

00:45.340 --> 00:47.170
<b>She has P.E. this afternoon.</b>

00:47.300 --> 00:48.220
<b>It's ridiculous.</b>

00:48.510 --> 00:52.970
<b>Do we really need P.E.?
Just being alive is exhausting enough.</b>

00:53.100 --> 00:54.390
<b>I strongly agree.</b>

00:54.510 --> 00:57.430
<b>I love doing stretches.</b>

00:57.560 --> 00:59.230
<b>- I don't.
- And moving around.</b>

00:59.350 --> 01:00.270
<b>I hate it.</b>

01:00.520 --> 01:01.730
<b>That art looks nice.</b>

01:00.520 --> 01:01.730
<b>I get it.</b>

01:01.850 --> 01:03.980
<b>You don't know this series?</b>

01:01.850 --> 01:03.980
<b>I thought you were athletic.</b>

01:04.110 --> 01:08.360
<b>That's great.
You can enjoy it for the first time.</b>

01:04.110 --> 01:08.530
<b>I run pretty fast,
but I'm not that good at anything else.</b>

01:09.700 --> 01:12.660
<b>The newly released Volume 17
is so outstanding.</b>

01:12.780 --> 01:14.700
<b>Volume 17? That's a lot.</b>

01:14.830 --> 01:17.370
<b>No way! From the start of Volume 1...</b>

01:17.490 --> 01:20.370
<b>Stop, that's not
the good kind of spoiler.</b>

01:20.660 --> 01:24.210
<b>Miracle Drums Snappy-chan is special.</b>

01:22.670 --> 01:25.090
<b>Have some candy.</b>

01:24.380 --> 01:26.460
<b>I have the whole series!</b>

01:25.210 --> 01:26.460
<b>Thanks.</b>

01:26.710 --> 01:30.340
<b>Oh, Yuno-san, don't you have to change
before P.E.?</b>

01:30.470 --> 01:31.590
<b>It's almost time.</b>

01:31.720 --> 01:33.840
<b>No, I'm wearing it underneath.</b>

01:33.970 --> 01:35.220
<b>Your gym clothes?</b>

01:35.350 --> 01:37.220
<b>- Shorts too?
- Who cares?</b>

01:37.890 --> 01:40.480
<b>May I ask for more details?</b>

01:40.640 --> 01:43.230
<b>- No.
- Oh, um...</b>

01:44.020 --> 01:48.690
<b>I have a fairly important issue
I wanted to discuss with you carefully.</b>

01:48.980 --> 01:50.030
<b>What's wrong?</b>

01:50.150 --> 01:54.950
<b>I thought I should say something
about all the talk online.</b>

01:55.070 --> 01:58.450
<b>I agree.
Staying silent would be a bad move.</b>

01:59.290 --> 02:04.290
<b>But I have no idea what to do,
how to do it, or what to say...</b>

02:04.460 --> 02:05.960
<b>What about that thing?</b>

02:06.380 --> 02:07.590
<b>That thing?</b>

02:07.710 --> 02:09.090
<b>On the beach...</b>

02:09.840 --> 02:14.300
<b>You told me you've been keeping
all the words we've shared.</b>

02:15.340 --> 02:17.640
<b>That's not going to help at all.</b>

02:17.760 --> 02:22.180
<b>Of course it will.
Those are your true feelings, right?</b>

02:26.520 --> 02:28.730
<b>Yeah, maybe you're right.</b>

02:29.230 --> 02:31.990
<b>It represents everything
that I'm feeling now.</b>

02:32.150 --> 02:33.450
<b>From those words...</b>

02:33.570 --> 02:35.700
<b>Sorry, but what's this about?</b>

02:35.820 --> 02:37.740
<b>Oh, um...</b>

02:39.330 --> 02:40.450
<b>It's this.</b>

02:41.240 --> 02:44.580
<b>0 Following, 0 Followers</b>

02:41.660 --> 02:44.580
<b>An account I made when
I locked myself in my room.</b>

02:45.170 --> 02:48.750
<b>I've been using it since then
as a place to talk to myself.</b>

02:49.040 --> 02:53.840
<b>Showing what's behind-the-scenes
to draw people in is totally valid.</b>

02:53.970 --> 02:56.840
<b>Whining and sympathy can go to hell,</b>

02:57.220 --> 03:02.890
<b>but turning it into a song to shape
public perception might be a good idea.</b>

03:03.020 --> 03:04.520
<b>Is this a new you?</b>

03:04.640 --> 03:06.020
<b>I am who I am.</b>

03:06.190 --> 03:08.440
<b>Evolution!</b>

03:08.560 --> 03:09.520
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:09.940 --> 03:12.320
<b>I don't need this anymore.</b>

03:10.570 --> 03:12.320
<b>Writing lyrics is so hard</b>

03:13.150 --> 03:16.150
<b>So I want to let my words
out into the world.</b>

03:16.780 --> 03:17.820
<b>Can you do it?</b>

03:17.950 --> 03:18.910
<b>Yes!</b>

03:19.780 --> 03:20.950
<b>I see.</b>

03:21.540 --> 03:25.540
<b>You want to unlock the account
along with the lyrics.</b>

03:26.040 --> 03:32.210
<b>Yes, so I wanted to ask whether
it's a yes or no from the agency.</b>

03:32.380 --> 03:33.170
<b>Sounds good.</b>

03:33.340 --> 03:34.800
<b>- Really?!
- Sure.</b>

03:35.170 --> 03:38.430
<b>If you feel like putting
your "now" into lyrics.</b>

03:38.550 --> 03:39.510
<b>Yep, yep.</b>

03:39.640 --> 03:41.640
<b>- Then...
- That said!</b>

03:41.930 --> 03:44.100
<b>Risk management is important.</b>

03:44.220 --> 03:47.690
<b>Let me check the content
of the account first.</b>

03:47.980 --> 03:49.150
<b>Okay!</b>

04:01.200 --> 04:02.950
<b>That's a massive amount.</b>

04:03.080 --> 04:05.120
<b>Well... it's a year's worth.</b>

04:05.250 --> 04:07.290
<b>Isn't this a bit too personal?</b>

04:07.410 --> 04:08.500
<b>No, it's fine!</b>

04:09.040 --> 04:12.040
<b>"There's no one here, so I can talk."</b>

04:12.170 --> 04:14.130
<b>"All I have is my singing."</b>

04:14.250 --> 04:16.630
<b>"They can't know it's my voice."</b>

04:17.050 --> 04:18.550
<b>"I'll stop being me."</b>

04:18.680 --> 04:20.140
<b>Because this now is me!</b>

04:20.890 --> 04:21.680
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:22.010 --> 04:24.890
<b>"Opened the curtains.
Turns out the sky is blue."</b>

04:25.180 --> 04:28.770
<b>"She's starting a new series.
Woohoo! I'm so happy!"</b>

04:28.890 --> 04:30.020
<b>Is it about you?</b>

04:30.150 --> 04:30.940
<b>Could it be?</b>

04:31.230 --> 04:35.780
<b>"Meeting the others from my agency.
I'm so nervous."</b>

04:35.900 --> 04:37.570
<b>This one's about us!</b>

04:39.490 --> 04:40.410
<b>So embarrassing.</b>

04:40.530 --> 04:41.620
<b>No, it isn't.</b>

04:41.870 --> 04:43.990
<b>I was nervous too!</b>

04:44.330 --> 04:47.750
<b>"Today, I became MewType.
I'm starting a new life."</b>

04:47.870 --> 04:48.830
<b>"No bands!"</b>

04:48.960 --> 04:52.250
<b>"But I'm happy they said
they love my singing!"</b>

04:52.380 --> 04:56.090
<b>"Dreams are power! Dreams are power!
And repeat."</b>

04:56.210 --> 05:01.640
<b>"We met... but I can't face her.
I'll take a different path tomorrow."</b>

05:01.930 --> 05:04.760
<b>"Truth is,
I have so much I want to say."</b>

05:05.060 --> 05:09.940
<b>It was my choice to make it public,
but I'm so embarrassed...</b>

05:10.940 --> 05:12.770
<b>I can talk just fine.</b>

05:14.900 --> 05:15.770
<b>I...</b>

05:16.780 --> 05:18.860
<b>I can talk just fine.</b>

05:19.360 --> 05:21.490
<b>MewType Official
New Song! 'in my words'</b>

05:21.610 --> 05:24.950
<b>Lyrics by Arale Nakamachi!
Here's the song and one more thing</b>

05:25.080 --> 05:26.410
<b>I'm embarassed, but I hope you'll listen</b>

05:26.870 --> 05:29.660
<b>I finally... released it...</b>

05:35.090 --> 05:37.170
<b>What? Utami-san?!</b>

05:35.710 --> 05:37.170
<b>I will discuss
what really happened...</b>

05:37.590 --> 05:40.510
<b>"Erea-chan, I would like your opinion
on how I sing this part."</b>

05:40.630 --> 05:43.430
<b>"I heard it! I think it's really good!"</b>

05:43.550 --> 05:48.100
<b>"Compared to that, I'm...
not so great, huh?"</b>

05:48.970 --> 05:50.640
<b>Is this the sequel?</b>

05:49.270 --> 05:51.560
<b>"Personally, I'd say it's terrible."</b>

05:50.770 --> 05:52.690
<b>Traitor to criminals</b>

05:51.690 --> 05:54.730
<b>"Come on! This part definitely
needs to be growled out!"</b>

05:54.860 --> 05:56.060
<b>I'm tired of this</b>

05:54.860 --> 05:56.770
<b>"Why is it so hard to understand?"</b>

05:56.730 --> 05:58.400
<b>Re-record it!</b>

05:57.110 --> 06:00.030
<b>You're a bit late, Utami-san.</b>

06:00.440 --> 06:02.320
<b>I bet A-ko's in it too.</b>

06:03.570 --> 06:07.700
<b>If you really wanted to help,
you should've done it back then.</b>

06:08.990 --> 06:10.370
<b>Coward.</b>

06:11.120 --> 06:12.660
<b>What're we going to do?</b>

06:12.790 --> 06:13.580
<b>Who knows?</b>

06:13.710 --> 06:14.620
<b>Come on.</b>

06:14.750 --> 06:18.340
<b>Shouldn't we put this out
before it gets ugly?</b>

06:20.170 --> 06:21.380
<b>So lame.</b>

06:21.670 --> 06:25.890
<b>You were quick to attack others,
and now you're silent?</b>

06:26.010 --> 06:29.600
<b>But can an apology
really fix this at this point?</b>

06:29.720 --> 06:33.140
<b>It's unforgivable,
whether you cry or tell the truth.</b>

06:33.560 --> 06:36.980
<b>You were clearly acting out of malice</b>

06:37.110 --> 06:39.400
<b>to bring down Arale Nakamachi.</b>

06:39.520 --> 06:41.820
<b>You were mean to Clematis too!</b>

06:41.940 --> 06:44.820
<b>That was another way
to target Arale Nakamachi.</b>

06:44.950 --> 06:47.120
<b>- And getting her on stage?
- Yeah.</b>

06:47.240 --> 06:50.290
<b>But it did make the event more exciting.</b>

06:50.410 --> 06:52.950
<b>It literally doubled our followers.</b>

06:53.080 --> 06:54.210
<b>Viola.</b>

06:54.830 --> 06:56.420
<b>You're impressive.</b>

06:56.540 --> 06:59.590
<b>But you're too fixated
on Arale Nakamachi.</b>

06:59.710 --> 07:02.840
<b>I've already reported
what you did to the agency.</b>

07:03.210 --> 07:07.680
<b>Don't drag me into this.
You're the only one getting flamed.</b>

07:12.640 --> 07:15.560
<b>If it weren't for this,
Fairy Bouquet could've...</b>

07:15.850 --> 07:16.980
<b>No, we couldn't have.</b>

07:17.940 --> 07:20.730
<b>Me and the two of you?</b>

07:22.440 --> 07:23.360
<b>We won't go anywhere.</b>

07:23.990 --> 07:26.070
<b>- What?!
- Quiet down. What is it?</b>

07:26.530 --> 07:29.320
<b>Fairy Bouquet
Manager Hanaoka</b>

07:26.570 --> 07:29.320
<b>They're terminating our contract!</b>

07:29.490 --> 07:31.830
<b>Huh? Why us?</b>

07:33.790 --> 07:38.080
<b>I've reported
your rule violations to the agency.</b>

07:38.790 --> 07:42.000
<b>I didn't expect them
to respond this quickly.</b>

07:42.130 --> 07:43.710
<b>Why is it just us?</b>

07:44.210 --> 07:50.470
<b>Everything you told the agency
has already been reported by Clematis.</b>

07:50.720 --> 07:54.640
<b>The reason I still remain
is because I have value.</b>

07:55.060 --> 08:00.190
<b>As long as I can provide value,
I can come back to life again and again.</b>

08:01.480 --> 08:04.440
<b>You're the worst... Let's go!</b>

08:06.700 --> 08:08.660
<b>Bye-bye!</b>

08:11.910 --> 08:13.790
<b>It's starting to rain.</b>

08:16.200 --> 08:18.960
<b>Here you go, our seasonal parfait.</b>

08:19.080 --> 08:20.830
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:25.300 --> 08:28.010
<b>Manager Hanaoka:
Your termination has been accepted.</b>

08:31.010 --> 08:32.600
<b>It's sparkling.</b>

08:36.890 --> 08:39.770
<b>- Fairy Bouquet.
- I hear that name a lot.</b>

08:39.890 --> 08:43.400
<b>That song's great.
I've been listening to it nonstop.</b>

08:43.570 --> 08:45.860
<b>Fairy Bouquet's Viola
has the ultimate face.</b>

08:45.690 --> 08:46.900
<b>Fairy Bouquet
Debut single out now!</b>

08:45.980 --> 08:48.570
<b>I know! She's the best, isn't she?</b>

08:47.610 --> 08:51.280
<b>Like the final sparkle of fireworks.</b>

08:49.030 --> 08:51.660
<b>How is she so beautiful?</b>

08:52.120 --> 08:56.870
<b>She captures everyone's eyes
for an instant, and then it's over.</b>

08:59.370 --> 09:02.040
<b>I wanted to become a light.</b>

09:02.710 --> 09:08.590
<b>Someone who can make everyone smile
and lift even those who are feeling low.</b>

09:09.720 --> 09:10.840
<b>Sparkling...</b>

09:11.510 --> 09:12.890
<b>Flickering...</b>

09:13.800 --> 09:16.600
<b>The more I tried to shine,</b>

09:17.140 --> 09:18.980
<b>the more fake I became.</b>

09:19.930 --> 09:21.310
<b>Fake kindness.</b>

09:21.940 --> 09:23.310
<b>Fake songs.</b>

09:23.730 --> 09:25.190
<b>Fake smiles.</b>

09:25.480 --> 09:27.690
<b>Fake brilliance.</b>

09:28.650 --> 09:30.400
<b>Everything that isn't real</b>

09:30.530 --> 09:32.200
<b>is fake.</b>

09:32.910 --> 09:33.820
<b>Even so!</b>

09:34.320 --> 09:37.160
<b>Everyone's smiling faces and voices</b>

09:37.290 --> 09:38.830
<b>make me Viola!</b>

09:39.410 --> 09:44.920
<b>So I have no choice
but to shine in my own fake way!</b>

09:48.130 --> 09:52.630
<b>"I won't let this end in an instant,
like fireworks."</b>

09:53.640 --> 09:58.560
<b>This line feels like determination,
and I really loved it.</b>

10:00.600 --> 10:05.100
<b>I wanted to talk with everyone too.</b>

10:05.230 --> 10:06.400
<b>Uh... Excuse me!</b>

10:06.820 --> 10:09.110
<b>- H-hold on!
- You're Viola-chan.</b>

10:09.230 --> 10:10.240
<b>No way! You're real?</b>

10:10.360 --> 10:14.030
<b>Please! Can I take a picture with you?</b>

10:16.320 --> 10:17.740
<b>Of course!</b>

10:24.750 --> 10:26.380
<b>Are you okay?</b>

10:26.500 --> 10:28.340
<b>You shouldn't try too hard.</b>

10:28.550 --> 10:30.710
<b>- It just makes it worse.
- What?!</b>

10:30.960 --> 10:35.640
<b>Take a deep breath to calm your mind
and steady your breathing.</b>

10:35.760 --> 10:38.930
<b>There's a huge crowd!</b>

10:39.060 --> 10:40.140
<b>Arale-chan!</b>

10:40.270 --> 10:42.890
<b>Y-Yuno-san!
What if she isn't breathing?!</b>

10:43.480 --> 10:45.850
<b>Uh... Just try to wake her up.</b>

10:46.190 --> 10:48.860
<b>We got a cake as a treat, so let's eat!</b>

10:49.320 --> 10:52.440
<b>Arale-chan! There's cake!
We can do this!</b>

10:57.990 --> 10:59.330
<b>Ready?</b>

10:59.450 --> 11:00.990
<b>- Chocolate.
- Apple pie.</b>

11:01.330 --> 11:03.870
<b>- We all picked a different one!
- Perfect.</b>

11:04.910 --> 11:06.920
<b>- M-Miyako-san...
- Yes?</b>

11:07.460 --> 11:09.540
<b>- Aren't you...
- I'm nervous.</b>

11:09.670 --> 11:11.340
<b>You don't look like it!</b>

11:11.460 --> 11:14.920
<b>Well, even if I mess up...</b>

11:13.090 --> 11:14.970
<b>- Fork!
- Thank you.</b>

11:15.180 --> 11:18.010
<b>what's a little more embarrassment?</b>

11:18.140 --> 11:20.220
<b>Ah... huh? Really?</b>

11:20.810 --> 11:22.640
<b>Are you nervous, Arale-chan?</b>

11:22.770 --> 11:23.850
<b>Take a deep breath.</b>

11:28.020 --> 11:28.860
<b>Ha!</b>

11:30.820 --> 11:32.070
<b>Feel more relaxed?</b>

11:32.190 --> 11:35.030
<b>No, my heart's racing even more!</b>

11:35.150 --> 11:39.280
<b>I'm just so happy I get
to be in a band with all of you!</b>

11:40.580 --> 11:41.490
<b>Why now?</b>

11:41.830 --> 11:43.540
<b>This is really delicious.</b>

11:43.660 --> 11:44.540
<b>- Yeah.
- Yes.</b>

11:44.660 --> 11:45.750
<b>You eat so fast.</b>

11:45.870 --> 11:48.330
<b>Perfect for a pre-battle sugar boost.</b>

11:48.460 --> 11:50.380
<b>- A battle?
- It's a live show.</b>

11:50.960 --> 11:53.090
<b>Ricchan!</b>

11:54.210 --> 11:57.010
<b>Can you tie my hair?</b>

11:59.390 --> 12:02.260
<b>I've always worn pigtails when I sing.</b>

12:02.390 --> 12:03.810
<b>Sure. Sit down.</b>

12:03.930 --> 12:05.430
<b>I've got hair ties!</b>

12:05.560 --> 12:07.350
<b>- Thanks.
- Here's a brush.</b>

12:07.480 --> 12:08.560
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:08.690 --> 12:10.940
<b>Sugar also helps calm your nerves.</b>

12:11.060 --> 12:12.150
<b>Okay.</b>

12:25.580 --> 12:26.700
<b>All done.</b>

12:29.370 --> 12:30.580
<b>Thanks.</b>

12:30.920 --> 12:32.040
<b>Is this okay?</b>

12:33.840 --> 12:36.710
<b>Yeah. This is who I am.</b>

12:36.970 --> 12:39.340
<b>We're used to it on the VRFloor.</b>

12:40.890 --> 12:43.720
<b>MewType just got another upgrade!</b>

12:45.930 --> 12:47.430
<b>What version is it now?</b>

12:47.560 --> 12:48.810
<b>Isn't it 4.0?</b>

12:48.940 --> 12:51.560
<b>Wasn't it upgraded twice
during practice?</b>

12:51.690 --> 12:55.070
<b>- Eight, nine, ten...
- Tiny updates are annoying.</b>

12:55.780 --> 12:57.570
<b>Let's just make it infinite.</b>

12:57.780 --> 13:00.280
<b>Yuno-chan, you're a genius!</b>

13:00.410 --> 13:02.240
<b>"Mugen" for "infinite versions."</b>

13:02.370 --> 13:03.450
<b>Like this?</b>

13:03.620 --> 13:05.950
<b>MewType ver.∞
(Mugen? Mugendai?)</b>

13:07.500 --> 13:08.960
<b>How about "dream"?</b>

13:09.330 --> 13:10.750
<b>- Dream?
- Yes!</b>

13:11.170 --> 13:13.790
<b>Turn the "infinite" character
into "dream."</b>

13:14.460 --> 13:15.710
<b>Mugendai MewType</b>

13:15.960 --> 13:17.260
<b>Oh, that looks nice.</b>

13:17.380 --> 13:18.840
<b>Nice!</b>

13:20.340 --> 13:22.840
<b>We'll dream as many times as it takes.</b>

13:23.050 --> 13:24.850
<b>We're Mugendai MewType!</b>

13:25.010 --> 13:27.470
<b>Hey! Sorry I'm late!</b>

13:27.810 --> 13:28.600
<b>Our outfits!</b>

13:28.730 --> 13:31.520
<b>Right! I was so scared!</b>

13:31.640 --> 13:34.150
<b>Someone must have misplaced them...</b>

13:34.980 --> 13:36.820
<b>Nakamachi-san, what's wrong?</b>

13:36.940 --> 13:38.320
<b>She'll be fine.</b>

13:45.990 --> 13:48.200
<b>The crowd's gotten bigger!</b>

13:48.330 --> 13:50.710
<b>It all turned into good publicity.</b>

13:51.160 --> 13:53.330
<b>So it brought us some attention...</b>

13:53.790 --> 13:55.330
<b>I almost feel grateful.</b>

13:55.670 --> 13:56.500
<b>Arale-chan!</b>

13:56.630 --> 13:58.210
<b>Ricchan!</b>

13:58.550 --> 14:00.010
<b>Raki-chan, Bota-chan.</b>

14:00.130 --> 14:01.380
<b>You came!</b>

14:01.510 --> 14:02.430
<b>Of course!</b>

14:02.550 --> 14:04.840
<b>Our classmates are over there too.</b>

14:05.010 --> 14:06.050
<b>We're all here.</b>

14:06.180 --> 14:08.720
<b>- Really?
- Arale-chan.</b>

14:10.140 --> 14:12.480
<b>- I'm sorry.
- Excuse me.</b>

14:12.640 --> 14:13.810
<b>I knew it!</b>

14:13.940 --> 14:16.190
<b>Utami-san... A-ko...</b>

14:18.650 --> 14:21.440
<b>I've been worried about you
all this time.</b>

14:22.990 --> 14:24.110
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:27.830 --> 14:28.740
<b>Good luck.</b>

14:28.870 --> 14:30.370
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:33.500 --> 14:35.370
<b>Let's go!</b>

14:40.420 --> 14:41.920
<b>Let's go.</b>

14:44.220 --> 14:47.260
<b><i>From the murky depths of what I can't say</i></b>

14:47.430 --> 14:50.970
<b><i>What overflowed was</i></b>

14:51.180 --> 14:52.770
<b><i>Still nameless</i></b>

14:52.890 --> 14:56.060
<b><i>Not knowing why
But somehow</i></b>

14:56.230 --> 14:58.900
<b><i>I can't stay still anymore
Just run</i></b>

15:15.330 --> 15:20.500
<b><i>I can't say it well
So I'll stay quiet</i></b>

15:20.750 --> 15:22.090
<b><i>It won't reach anyone</i></b>

15:22.210 --> 15:27.300
<b><i>Not even once in my life
A one-way road</i></b>

15:27.430 --> 15:28.640
<b><i>Is that what I want?</i></b>

15:29.720 --> 15:32.850
<b><i>I love you so much I want to run</i></b>

15:32.970 --> 15:36.270
<b><i>I only wanted someone to hear it</i></b>

15:36.520 --> 15:39.690
<b><i>What kept overflowing</i></b>

15:39.810 --> 15:42.940
<b><i>Was a light that guides the way forward</i></b>

15:44.030 --> 15:47.070
<b><i>This isn't for me It's not like me
It's never that easy</i></b>

15:47.200 --> 15:50.280
<b><i>The connection I let go of with you</i></b>

15:50.490 --> 15:53.620
<b><i>I'm trying again
I don't want to live with regret</i></b>

15:53.790 --> 15:56.870
<b><i>This song must be our dialogue</i></b>

15:57.040 --> 15:58.120
<b><i>In my words</i></b>

15:58.750 --> 16:01.170
<b><i>True words
(I want to vanish)</i></b>

16:01.290 --> 16:02.880
<b><i>I want to sing
(I need to change)</i></b>

16:03.000 --> 16:04.010
<b><i>Dreams are power</i></b>

16:04.260 --> 16:06.380
<b><i>This is a new life
(Stop being me)</i></b>

16:06.510 --> 16:08.340
<b><i>I want to sing I want to sing
(A scary dream) (I'm done)</i></b>

16:08.510 --> 16:11.470
<b><i>I have to give it a voice
That's why I perform live</i></b>

16:12.010 --> 16:14.520
<b><i>What went wrong between us</i></b>

16:14.640 --> 16:17.020
<b><i>And what I should have done</i></b>

16:17.140 --> 16:20.440
<b><i>I still don't know
But it's not the end</i></b>

16:20.560 --> 16:25.230
<b><i>Some day, in a dream we keep returning to
It's waiting for us</i></b>

16:25.360 --> 16:27.530
<b><i>It's waiting</i></b>

16:28.860 --> 16:33.870
<b><i>I can't say it well
So I'll stay quiet</i></b>

16:34.330 --> 16:35.700
<b><i>The regret from that day</i></b>

16:35.830 --> 16:38.790
<b><i>When it didn't reach you</i></b>

16:38.920 --> 16:42.250
<b><i>I'll take it back
In this moment</i></b>

16:43.340 --> 16:46.340
<b><i>I love you so much I want to run</i></b>

16:46.550 --> 16:49.840
<b><i>I only wanted someone to hear it</i></b>

16:50.130 --> 16:52.970
<b><i>What kept overflowing</i></b>

16:53.140 --> 16:56.350
<b><i>Was a light that guides the way forward</i></b>

16:57.060 --> 16:59.980
<b><i>At the edge of my voice, I cried out</i></b>

17:00.600 --> 17:03.520
<b><i>I just wanted it to reach you</i></b>

17:04.110 --> 17:07.030
<b><i>With dreams that won't stop overflowing</i></b>

17:07.150 --> 17:10.530
<b><i>I can keep looking ahead again and again</i></b>

17:11.660 --> 17:14.780
<b><i>No one's here It won't connect
I don't even know why</i></b>

17:14.910 --> 17:17.830
<b><i>The connection I let go of with you</i></b>

17:18.160 --> 17:21.210
<b><i>I'm trying again
I don't want to live with regret</i></b>

17:21.330 --> 17:24.590
<b><i>This song must be our dialogue</i></b>

17:24.790 --> 17:27.800
<b><i>This song must be our dialogue</i></b>

17:28.050 --> 17:28.970
<b><i>In my words</i></b>

17:50.490 --> 17:51.400
<b>It's so fun.</b>

17:52.660 --> 17:54.030
<b>Yay!</b>

17:55.780 --> 17:59.870
<b>That was "in my words."
Thank you for listening.</b>

18:00.290 --> 18:03.790
<b>I'd be happy if we could sing
the next song together.</b>

18:04.500 --> 18:06.210
<b>"Love is Energy"</b>

18:09.800 --> 18:15.340
<b><i>In a world I could curse endlessly</i></b>

18:15.550 --> 18:20.390
<b><i>I found you</i></b>

18:20.520 --> 18:25.560
<b><i>The same blood runs in us both</i></b>

18:25.730 --> 18:31.150
<b><i>And that alone makes me happy</i></b>

18:31.530 --> 18:35.070
<b><i>You are my sun</i></b>

18:45.830 --> 18:50.880
<b><i>I kept dreaming without end</i></b>

18:51.460 --> 18:56.300
<b><i>Even if this journey comes to an end</i></b>

18:56.470 --> 19:01.720
<b><i>The path we shared together</i></b>

19:01.850 --> 19:06.980
<b><i>I know I won't forget it</i></b>

19:08.860 --> 19:14.070
<b><i>In an infinity of choices,</i></b>

19:14.240 --> 19:20.620
<b><i>I chose to walk on with you</i></b>

19:20.950 --> 19:26.040
<b><i>In a future beyond both dream and reality</i></b>

19:26.170 --> 19:29.540
<b><i>I could hear a voice calling me!</i></b>

19:31.170 --> 19:36.260
<b><i>Every time words turn bright, I have to say it!!!</i></b>

19:36.470 --> 19:39.010
<b><i>No matter the time,</i></b>

19:39.180 --> 19:42.010
<b><i>It's something precious, love is energy</i></b>

19:42.350 --> 19:47.060
<b><i>There's no answer, so it's up to you!!</i></b>

19:47.230 --> 19:49.730
<b><i>Even every fear</i></b>

19:49.900 --> 19:52.820
<b><i>Gets swept away by love as energy</i></b>

19:53.110 --> 19:59.030
<b><i>Past the edge of a dream I once saw, even further</i></b>

19:59.240 --> 20:07.830
<b><i>Let's keep the party going, beyond love and hate</i></b>

20:15.130 --> 20:17.930
<b><i>Beyond despair, I saw</i></b>

20:18.050 --> 20:20.680
<b><i>A sickness called hope</i></b>

20:18.340 --> 20:23.260
<b>And when it all gets mixed together,
that's when we can talk through songs!</b>

20:21.100 --> 20:25.770
<b><i>It shines so brightly it hurts</i></b>

20:25.060 --> 20:26.390
<b>You're right.</b>

20:26.180 --> 20:28.600
<b><i>In this endless world</i></b>

20:28.390 --> 20:33.900
<b>That's why I hate you so much,
Arale-chan.</b>

20:28.770 --> 20:31.110
<b><i>How much longer, I wonder,</i></b>

20:31.230 --> 20:37.280
<b><i>Can I stay with you?</i></b>

20:39.030 --> 20:44.330
<b><i>When it's time to say goodbye, I remember</i></b>

20:44.540 --> 20:49.670
<b><i>Your beautiful shadow, and how young we were</i></b>

20:49.830 --> 20:55.550
<b><i>If only I could draw "I'm sorry" and "thank you"</i></b>

20:59.180 --> 21:00.010
<b>Let's sing!</b>

21:00.470 --> 21:05.600
<b><i>Every time words turn bright, I have to say it</i></b>

21:05.850 --> 21:08.180
<b><i>No matter the time,</i></b>

21:08.480 --> 21:11.770
<b><i>It's something precious, love is energy</i></b>

21:11.940 --> 21:16.150
<b><i>Every time we pass, I get to know you more</i></b>

21:16.530 --> 21:18.780
<b><i>Even every fear</i></b>

21:19.200 --> 21:22.160
<b><i>Gets swept away by love as energy</i></b>

21:22.490 --> 21:27.080
<b><i>Past the edge of a dream I once saw, even further</i></b>

21:27.240 --> 21:35.710
<b><i>Let's keep the party going, beyond love and hate</i></b>

21:36.750 --> 21:38.380
<b>We're Mugendai MewType!</b>

21:38.960 --> 21:43.010
<b>I had an amazing time
talking with everyone!</b>

21:43.470 --> 21:45.300
<b>Ready?</b>

21:45.470 --> 21:49.640
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

22:03.860 --> 22:05.160
<b>Yeah, that's good.</b>

22:07.990 --> 22:10.330
<b>What's taking manager-san so long?</b>

22:10.450 --> 22:11.960
<b>It's not time yet.</b>

22:12.080 --> 22:13.420
<b>Oh, you're early.</b>

22:13.540 --> 22:17.170
<b>M-M-Manager-san, w-what's this?!</b>

22:16.380 --> 22:17.170
<b>National Live Tour</b>

22:18.250 --> 22:19.130
<b>A live tour!</b>

22:19.260 --> 22:20.760
<b>We're doing it!</b>

22:21.050 --> 22:23.090
<b>Now that you're Mugendai MewType.</b>

22:23.380 --> 22:26.350
<b>I believe in your spirit
and infinite potential!</b>

22:26.850 --> 22:31.180
<b>We want to keep releasing songs...
like one every three months?</b>

22:31.310 --> 22:33.390
<b>- Yeah.
- You can go monthly!</b>

22:33.520 --> 22:34.310
<b>As I thought.</b>

22:34.440 --> 22:35.440
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

22:35.560 --> 22:36.690
<b>We have to do it.</b>

22:36.810 --> 22:38.190
<b>Why?!</b>

22:39.610 --> 22:42.150
<b>I can talk with everyone through music!</b>

22:42.280 --> 22:45.200
<b>We also received
a new collaboration offer.</b>

22:45.780 --> 22:47.830
<b>We'll need to practice hard.</b>

22:47.950 --> 22:50.490
<b>- A training camp!
- Training camp, woo!</b>

22:50.620 --> 22:51.410
<b>I'll pass.</b>

22:51.540 --> 22:52.910
<b>I have a deadline too.</b>

22:53.040 --> 22:54.540
<b>You got away!</b>

22:54.790 --> 22:57.000
<b>I just keep moving toward reality.</b>

22:57.250 --> 23:00.960
<b>I'm going to talk through my songs!</b>

23:01.090 --> 23:02.380
<b>Don't shout.</b>

23:02.510 --> 23:05.180
<b>I'll eat every possible dish
across Japan!</b>

23:05.300 --> 23:09.050
<b>- I'll be Big Nono-chan 47!
- I have a deadline too.</b>

23:09.180 --> 23:11.600
<b>Yuno-chan! What's your resolution?</b>

23:11.720 --> 23:15.810
<b>- Huh? It's clearly a monthly new song.
- Wow!</b>

23:15.940 --> 23:18.650
<b>What's Big Nono-chan?</b>

23:18.770 --> 23:20.570
<b>Big Nono-chan is...</b>

23:21.940 --> 23:23.440
<b>What is it?</b>

23:25.150 --> 23:26.280
<b>Miyako-chan!</b>

23:26.410 --> 23:28.530
<b>Now then, everyone together.</b>

23:28.660 --> 23:29.990
<b>Mugendai...</b>

23:30.330 --> 23:34.370
<b>MewType!</b>

23:37.580 --> 23:39.880
<b>The End</b>
